ong-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nRaheja Interface Heights is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [Rera Approved](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nProject: Raheja Interface Heights\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Raheja Interface Heights Malad West\n\n---\n\n* Nagindas Khandwala College\n* Shri M.D. Shah Mahila College\n* Sunshine Pre School\n* Carmel Of St Joseph High School\n\n* Jankanyan Charitable Hospital\n* Vivanta Multi Speciality Hospital\n* Vinayak maternity and general hospital\n* Aditi Hospital\n\n* Infiniti Mall\n* The Mall\n* Kothari Milestone\n* Inorbit Mall\n\n* Parsley - The Lounge\n* Sanjay Ice Cream\n* Mozzarella Pizza Hub\n* Exotic The Dining Bar\n\n![K Raheja Corp](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/69_1678040155_k-raheja.webp)\n\n## [K Raheja Corp](/mumbai/sale/builder/k-raheja-corp-69)\n\nOngoing Projects: 11\n\nCompleted Projects: 4\n\nTotal Projects: 15\n\n---\n\nWith 40 years of experience K Raheja Corp is a success story spanning four decades and stands today as one of India’s leading developers. K Raheja Corp delivers aspirational spaces with distinct characteristics and attributes, making each of its offerings unique. The Company has also been ahead of the curve in the green development sector. With its buildings certified in the categories of Gold and Platinum, it has been recognized with awards across prestigious forums.   \n  \nSome of the projects by the group in Pune are Raheja Reserve in NIBM, Raheja Sterling in NIBM and Raheja Viva in the lap of nature at paud road. Their projects like Raheja Vivarea at Mahalaxmi and Raheja Artesia at Worli have already claimed them a top spot in the list of Luxury Creators. With the upsurge in the Indian real estate sector, K Raheja Corp is one of the main proponents that will level the playing field for India with other developed economies.  \n  \n[Properties in Pune by K Raheja Corp](https://houssed.com/pune/sale/builder/k-raheja-corp-69), [Properties in Hyderabad by K Raheja Corp](https://houssed.com/hyderabad/sale/builder/k-raheja-corp-69), [Properties in Mumbai by K Raheja Corp](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/k-raheja-corp-69), [Properties in Navi Mumbai by K Raheja Corp](https://houssed.com/navi.mumbai/sale/builder/k-raheja-corp-69)\n\n## About Raheja Interface Heights, Mumbai, Malad West\n\n---\n\n# Raheja Interface Heights, Malad West – 2 & 3 BHK Flats by K Raheja Corp in Mumbai\n\n**Raheja Interface Heights** is a residential flat project located in **Malad West, Mumbai**, developed by **K Raheja Corp**, and marked as **RERA Approved**.\n\nThe project offers **2 and 3 BHK flats** with carpet areas ranging from **710 sq ft to 975 sq ft**, making it suitable for buyers looking for **mid-sized homes in a well-connected Mumbai suburb**.\n\nThis project is positioned for buyers who want **practical apartment sizes in Malad West with strong connectivity and established infrastructure**.\n\n---\n\n## Why Raheja Interface Heights Gets Attention in Malad West\n\nMalad West is one of Mumbai’s most active residential zones, driven by commercial hubs, metro connectivity, and lifestyle infrastructure.\n\nKey buyer considerations:\n\n• Developed by **K Raheja Corp (established developer credibility)**  \n • Located in a well-developed suburb of Mumbai  \n • 2 & 3 BHK configurations suited for urban families  \n • Carpet sizes designed for practical city living\n\nThis makes it relevant for buyers prioritising **location advantage and daily convenience over large layouts**.\n\n---\n\n## Who Should Consider This Project\n\n**Suitable for:**\n\n• Working professionals in **Malad, Goregaon, Andheri**  \n • Families looking for **2 or 3 BHK flats in Mumbai**  \n • Buyers wanting **ready infrastructure and connectivity**  \n • End-use buyers preferring reputed developers\n\n**Less suitable for:**\n\n• Buyers looking for budget housing options  \n • Those wanting large or luxury-sized apartments  \n • Investors expecting low entry price points\n\n---\n\n## Location Advantage – Living in Malad West\n\nMalad West is a mature residential location with strong connectivity and lifestyle support.\n\nKey location benefits:\n\n• Connectivity via **Western Railway line (Malad station)**  \n • Access to **Link Road, SV Road, and Western Express Highway**  \n • Proximity to **Mindspace, Infinity IT Park, Goregaon business hubs**  \n • Well-developed ecosystem with malls, schools, hospitals\n\nThis location supports **end-use living with strong daily convenience and stable demand**.\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Breakdown – Space & Usability\n\n| Configuration | Carpet Area | Practical Use |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | ~710 sq ft | Suitable for small families or couples |\n| 3 BHK | Up to 975 sq ft | Comfortable for mid-sized families |\n\n**Practical insight:**\n\n• Efficient layouts designed for urban usage  \n • Suitable for families needing balanced space  \n • Limited configuration range but focused usability\n\n---\n\n## Project Positioning – What You’re Actually Buying\n\nRaheja Interface Heights is a **mid-sized residential development focused on practical living in Mumbai**.\n\nWhat that means:\n\n• Focus on efficient layouts rather than large township living  \n • Strong emphasis on location and connectivity  \n • Suitable for long-term residential use\n\n---\n\n## Daily Living Reality\n\nWhat supports daily life:\n\n• Close proximity to offices and business hubs  \n • Availability of schools, hospitals, shopping malls  \n • Established public transport network\n\nWhat buyers should verify:\n\n• Traffic congestion during peak hours  \n • Noise levels due to city environment  \n • Parking allocation and visitor parking  \n • Internal road access and entry/exit points\n\n---\n\n## Cost of Living – Important Considerations\n\nApart from property price, plan for:\n\n• Higher maintenance charges (Mumbai standards)  \n • Electricity and water costs  \n • Parking charges  \n • Daily commute and lifestyle expenses\n\nMalad West has a **moderate to high cost of living due to location advantage**.\n\n---\n\n## Raheja Interface Heights vs Other Malad West Projects\n\n| Factor | Raheja Interface Heights | Typical Malad West Projects |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Developer | K Raheja Corp | Mixed developers |\n| Configurations | 2 & 3 BHK | 1, 2, 3 BHK mix |\n| Carpet Size | Mid-range (710–975 sq ft) | Varies widely |\n| Target Buyer | End-use focused | Mixed |\n| Location Strength | High | Depends on micro-location |\n\nThis project fits buyers who prioritise **brand, location, and usability over budget flexibility**.\n\n---\n\n## Work-From-Home Suitability\n\n• 2 BHK – Basic WFH setup possible  \n • 3 BHK – Comfortable WFH environment\n\nWorks well for professionals with **hybrid or remote work setups**.\n\n---\n\n## Project Status & Key Checks\n\n• RERA Status: **Approved**\n\nBefore making a decision:\n\n• Verify RERA registration details on official MahaRERA portal  \n • Check construction stage and possession timeline  \n • Confirm layout plans and usable space  \n • Review agreement terms and additional charges\n\n---\n\n## After Moving In – What Residents Typically Experience\n\n• Peak-hour traffic congestion  \n • Strong access to daily essentials and services  \n • Noise levels typical of Mumbai suburbs  \n • High livability due to developed infrastructure\n\nA **physical site visit is essential** to understand real-world conditions.\n\n---\n\n## Final Verdict – Should You Consider Raheja Interface Heights?\n\nRaheja Interface Heights in Malad West is suitable for buyers who:\n\n• Want **2 & 3 BHK flats in Mumbai with strong connectivity**  \n • Prefer a **reputed developer like K Raheja Corp**  \n • Are focused on **end-use rather than speculative investment**  \n • Value **location, infrastructure, and daily convenience**\n\nIt may not suit buyers looking for **budget housing or large luxury layouts**, but it works well for **practical urban living in Mumbai**.\n\n## FAQ's about Raheja Interface Heights Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Malad West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Malad West\n\n* [Apartments in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Malad West\n\n* [New Projects in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Malad West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Malad West\n\n* [Homes in Malad West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 1 Cr to 2 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-1-cr-to-2-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 2 Cr to 5 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-2-cr-to-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 50 Lakh to 1 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/fla