)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.81 Cr to 2.45 Cr\\*\n\n![K Raheja Interface Heights](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/59724/1625811871_e3.jpeg \"K Raheja Interface Heights\")\n\n# K Raheja Interface Heights in Malad West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![K Raheja Interface Heights](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/59724/1625811871_e3.jpeg \"K Raheja Interface Heights\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 652 sqft - 883 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 310 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: Acres\n* Possession: March, 2013\n* Rera:\n\n## About\n\nK Raheja Interface Heights is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Malad West locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features 310 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 3 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 652 sqft to 883 sqft. The address for the project is situated off link road, just behind infiniti mall, western suburbs, mumbai, maharashtra..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at K Raheja Interface Heights are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 652 sqft. The larger 3 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 883 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at K Raheja Interface Heights are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 1.81 Cr and 3 BHK+3T Apartments from 2.45 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by K Raheja Realty, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is To Be Updated. Possession is expected to begin in 2013-03-13, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nK Raheja Interface Heights is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden. The security features include CCTV, Fire Alarm for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: 310 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 652 sqft to 883 sqft\n* Project Address: situated off link road, just behind infiniti mall, western suburbs, mumbai, maharashtra.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: K Raheja Realty\n* RERA Registration No.: To Be Updated\n* Possession Start: 2013-03-13\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV, Fire Alarm\n* Sports Facilities: Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nK Raheja Interface Heights benefits from its location in Malad West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at K Raheja Interface Heights will begin in 2013-03-13, and the project is RERA registered under To Be Updated. Developed by K Raheja Realty, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n* ![Fire Alarm](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804761_fire-alarm.svg) Fire Alarm\n\n## Floor Plans of K Raheja Interface Heights\n\n![K Raheja Interface Heights Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/59724/1625811745_2bhk1.jpeg \"K Raheja Interface Heights Floor Plan 652 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (652 Sq. Ft.)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1.45 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-k-raheja-interface-heights-malad-west-mumbai-prop59724)\n\n## Bank Offers for K Raheja Interface Heights\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528957944_reliance_capital.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528956975_dhfl.png \" \")\n\n![imageBackh](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/imageBackh.png)\n\n## Hi! I'm here to answer all your queries.\n\n**Vaishali Vasant Tiwari**  \n Relationship Manager\n\n[Chat with us](https://wa.me/8800117588?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20K Raheja Interface Heights)\n\n## K Raheja Interface Heights Specifications\n\n![Flooring](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor.svg)\n\nFlooring\n\nVitrified tiles in drawing/dining/bedrooms and kitchen.\n\n![Ground Water](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/