BHK Flats\n\nReady To Move\n\n[₹1.03 Lac EMI](https://www.magicbricks.com/homeloan/emi-calculator?inc=homeloan_web_pdp_top_emi_calculator)\n\nEstimated Rent: ₹62000 - ₹110000\n\nView Phone No.Contact Seller\n\nTotal Units\n\n310\n\nProject Size\n\n1 Acre\n\nLaunch Date\n\nJun 2009\n\nTotal towers\n\n7\n\nBHK\n\n2\n\nView Amenities (17)View Specifications\n\n## Properties in K Raheja Interface Heights\n\nBuy Rent\n\n[All](https://www.magicbricks.com/k-raheja-interface-heights-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303030383238)[1 BHK](https://www.magicbricks.com/k-raheja-interface-heights-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303030383238)[2 BHK](https://www.magicbricks.com/k-raheja-interface-heights-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303030383238)[3 BHK](https://www.magicbricks.com/k-raheja-interface-heights-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303030383238)\n\n![Image 6: K Raheja Interface Heights 3 BHK Flat 925 sq.ft](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVB5tA9dMyi7zr-NKVt80VOkYuZVcqc/Photo_h180_w240/84085155_10_PropertyImage132-90072484270732_180_240.jpg)Posted Today 11 Photos\n\n₹4.25 Cr₹2 lakh EMI\n\n3 BHK Flat 925 sq.ft\n\nReady to Move\n\n[You can find 3 BHK luxurious flat for sale in Mindspace, Mumbai. Being located in K Raheja Interface Heights, the property is easily accessible. This luxurious 3 BHK apartment comes with 1 covered, 1 open parking space for your vehicle. Priced at INR ₹4.25 Cr, this ready to move luxury apartment in Mindspace represents refined value. Positioned on 17 floor, the property spans carpet area 925 sqft. The structure contains 20 floor and features Guest Accommodation. The luxury home is fitted with power back up, reserved parking, security, intercom facility. Properties in K Raheja Interface Heights are available in 3 bhk flats, priced between ₹2.18 Cr - ₹3.34 Cr.](https://www.magicbricks.com/propertyDetails/3-BHK-1350-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Mindspace-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834303835313535)\n\nAgent: Ra