tps://www.magicbricks.com/project-k-raheja-interface-heights-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nMost Comprehensive& Credible Information\n\nInsights you won't find anywhere else\n\nTop Amenities\n\nNearby landmarks\n\nOnly on MB\n\nProject Reviews\n\n## About K Raheja Interface Heights Mumbai\n\nK Raheja Interface Heights is a Ready To Move project by K Raheja Realty in Malad West Mumbai, offering 3 BHK Flats configuration. Below are the key d...Read More\n\n## K Raheja Interface Heights Mumbai Top Amenities\n\nClub House\n\n★\n\nCycling & Jogging Track\n\n★\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nLift\n\nSecurity\n\nReserved Parking\n\nIntercom Facility\n\nGuest Accommodation\n\nGymnasium\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\nMeditation Area\n\nView All Amenitites (17)\n\nProject Details\n\nAbout Raheja Interface Heights\n\nK Raheja Interface Heights is a Ready To Move project by K Raheja Realty in Malad West Mumbai, offering 3 BHK Flats configuration. Below are the key details of K Raheja Interface Heights. \nK Raheja Interface Heights Price Rs. 2.18 Cr - 3.34 Cr\nProperty Types Flat\nProject Type Residential\nK Raheja Interface Heights Status Ready To Move\nK Raheja Interface Heights Launch Date 01 June 2009\nK Raheja Interface Heights Possession Date 01 March 2013\nTowers in K Raheja Interface Heights 7\n K Raheja Interface Heights is a well-known project located in Malad West, Mumbai, offering premium properties in the price range of Rs. 2.18 Cr - 3.34 Cr. K Raheja Interface Heights is smartly developed by the well-known builder K Raheja Realty. As of now, the project is in the Ready To Move position. It covers an area of 1 Acre. The project features a total of 310 units.\n\nA total of 7 towers are integrated into this residential society. The project was launched officially in June 2009.K Raheja Interface Heights has been granted its commencement certificate. Planning to invest in this exclusive property? You can visit the property at Interface Building, Off, New Link Road Behin