K Raheja Constructions also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Raheja Classique, Palm Court, Raheja Classique 3, Palm Springs , Raheja Heights, Raheja Heights, Raheja Classique, Raheja Heights Wing A, Raheja Heights Wing E, Raheja Residency, Palm Spring, Interface Heights , Radha Narayan. The property prices in Malad West are in the range of 13500 to 18500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects. K Raheja Constructions currently has 4 Ready Possession projects. Interface Heights has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5. You can download the brochure of Interface Heights and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website. The Bookings for the Ready Possession project Interface Heights are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience. Interface Heights is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n### Building remarks\n\ncompletely sold\n\n### 🗺️ Proximity & Distances\n\n✈️\n\nAirport\n\n30-40 min\n\n🚆\n\nRailway Station\n\n15 min\n\n🏥\n\nHospital\n\n15-020 min\n\n🏫\n\nSchool\n\n15 min\n\n### Building ratings\n\n4.2\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nBuilding\n\n8.1\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLocation\n\n7.2\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nAmenities\n\n7.9\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLegal\n\n7.4\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nValue for Money\n\n## K Raheja Realty\n\n**Developer:** [K Raheja Realty](/projects-in-k-raheja-realty)\n\n### More by K Raheja Realty\n\n[Raheja Residency, Goregaon West](/project/raheja-residency-goregaon-west/31972)[Raheja Residency Tower T, Malad East](/project/raheja-residency-tower-t-malad-east/31563)[Radha Narayan, Bandra West](/project/radha-narayan-bandra-west/11183)[Palm Spring, Malad West](/project/palm-spring-malad-west/7187)[Raheja Residency Tower F, Malad East](/project/raheja-residency-tower-f-malad-east/6547)[Raheja Heights Wing E, Goregaon East](/project/raheja-heights-wing-e-